# Citation

If you use AgentYield in research or a public benchmark, cite the repository:

```bibtex
@software{agentyield,
  title = {AgentYield: Local-first ROI and Evidence Ledger for AI Coding Agents},
  author = {Zhen Luo and Codex},
  year = {2026},
  url = {https://github.com/TTAWDTT/agentyield},
  license = {MIT}
}
```
